message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "cart: observability-aware, cost-aware regression testing for the Qiskit transpiler (Paper 3 registration and reproduction package)"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registration, code, data and reproduction recipes for a study of observability-aware, cost-aware regression
  test selection for the Qiskit transpiler, in which the pipeline chooses both which tests to run and which oracle
  each test gets within a continuous-integration budget.
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/furqan-nr/cart"
